#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:6
msgid "# Pair Programming v1 — Workbench Design"
msgstr "# 结对编程 v1 — 工作台设计"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:9
msgid ""
"> **Phase 1 ✅ Implemented** (2026-05-29): three-column UI, highlight.js "
"viewer, studio tree/file/search, xterm terminal, `studio-pair-programming` "
"platform.  > API shape is **tRPC** (`connectors/webui/src/trpc/routers/"
"studio.ts`), not REST examples below."
msgstr ""
"> **Phase 1 ✅ 已实现**（2026-05-29）：三列 UI、highlight.js 查看、studio "
"tree/file/search、xterm 终端、`studio-pair-programming` platform。 > API 形态"
"为 **tRPC**（`connectors/webui/src/trpc/routers/studio.ts`），非下文 REST 示"
"例。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Ship fast, not feature-complete:** Minimal viable scope to close the loop "
"of \"review code with Agent in Studio\""
msgstr ""
"**快速实现，不求功能完整**：用最小的可行范围跑通\"在 Studio 里和 Agent 一起看"
"代码\"的闭环"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Lightweight start:** File tree + file viewer + global search + chat + "
"terminal; no Monaco Editor yet"
msgstr ""
"**轻量化起步**：文件树 + 文件查看 + 全局搜索 + 对话 + 终端，暂不嵌入 Monaco "
"Editor"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Syntax highlighting via highlight.js** (not Monaco Editor) to reduce first "
"implementation cost"
msgstr "**代码高亮用 highlight.js**（而非 Monaco Editor），降低首次实现成本"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Read-only first:** v1 focuses on reading code; Agent analyzes and "
"suggests, no direct edit/save yet"
msgstr ""
"**只读起步**：v1 以读代码为主，Agent 分析、提建议，暂不提供直接编辑/保存"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Platform identity separation:** Pair programming sessions use dedicated "
"platform id, isolated from parlor chat sessions"
msgstr ""
"**平台身份分离**：结对编程会话用独立 platform 标识，与会客厅的聊天会话隔离"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Local direct read:** Files read server-side (not Probe); workspace path "
"configured in chamber settings"
msgstr ""
"**本地直读**：文件由服务端直接读取（非 Probe），workspace 路径在卧室配置"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:19
msgid ""
"**Terminal in Phase 1** (promoted from original Phase 2)—important for "
"debugging and ops"
msgstr ""
"**终端放在 Phase 1**（从原 Phase 2 提到 Phase 1），因为它对调试和运维很重要"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:21
msgid "## Overall Layout"
msgstr "## 整体布局"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/pair-programming-v1.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│  Studio                     [Pair Programming] [Novel] … │  ← StudioLayout sidebar\n"
"├──────────┬────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┤\n"
"│ 🔍 Search│                       │  💬 Session list      │\n"
"│ Files    │                       │  ┌──────────────────┐ │\n"
"│ ─────── │     Code viewer        │  │ session-001      │ │\n"
"│ src/     │    (highlight.js)      │  │ session-002      │ │\n"
"│   main.ts│                       │  │ session-003      │ │\n"
"│   utils/ │   Shows selected file  │  ├──────────────────┤ │\n"
"│   ...    │   syntax highlight,    │  │                  │ │\n"
"│          │   line numbers         │  │  Chat area        │ │\n"
"│ index.html│                      │  │  Agent: this code │ │\n"
"│ package.json│                    │  │  has a potential… │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │                  │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │  ┌──input──┐     │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │  │         │     │ │\n"
"└──────────┴────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘\n"
"   Left              Center                   Right\n"
"  file tree      highlight.js code viewer   session list + chat\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n"
"│  创作室 Studio              [结对编程] [小说] [短视频]   │  ← StudioLayout 侧边栏\n"
"├──────────┬────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┤\n"
"│ 🔍 搜索  │                       │  💬 会话列表          │\n"
"│ 文件     │                       │  ┌──────────────────┐ │\n"
"│ ─────── │     代码查看器         │  │ session-001      │ │\n"
"│ src/     │    (highlight.js)      │  │ session-002      │ │\n"
"│   main.ts│                       │  │ session-003      │ │\n"
"│   utils/ │   显示当前选中文件     │  ├──────────────────┤ │\n"
"│   ...    │   语法高亮、行号       │  │                  │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │  对话区           │ │\n"
"│ index.html│                      │  │  Agent：这段代码     │ │\n"
"│ package.json│                    │  │  有个潜在问题…   │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │                  │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │  ┌──输入框──┐   │ │\n"
"│          │                       │  │  │          │   │ │\n"
"└──────────┴────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘\n"
"   左列             中列                   右列\n"
"  文件树        highlight.js 代码查看    会话列表 + 对话\n"
"```\n"

